OL,3,ALindsay Clancy appears in court as her
OL,4,Alawyer pushes for murder case to be
OL,5,Adismissed
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS mother Lindsay Clancy has appeared
OL,8,Fin court for the first time since her
OL,9,Fmurder trial fell apart, with lawyers
OL,10,Fon both sides arguing how to proceed
OL,11,Fwith the case
OL,13,FHer defence argued that the judge
OL,14,Fshould use his power to declare her not
OL,15,Fguilty
OL,17,FBut prosecutors say the state "met its
OL,18,Fburden" in proving Clancy's guilt - 12
OL,19,Fjurors failed to reach a verdict during
OL,20,Fthe trial
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
