OL,3,ALindsay Clancy appears in court as her
OL,4,Alawyer pushes for murder case to be
OL,5,Adismissed
OL,6,
OL,7,FBoth sides resisted the judge's request
OL,8,Fto decide a potential retrial date -
OL,9,F"believe it or not, I agree with her,"
OL,10,FClancy's defence said of the prosecutor
OL,12,FThe judge will also consider a separate
OL,13,Frequest from the defence to dismiss the
OL,14,Fcase entirely on 2 November
OL,16,FClancy, 36, has admitted killing her
OL,17,Fchildren, but she pleaded not guilty to
OL,18,Fmurder, arguing she had postpartum
OL,19,Fpsychosis at the time
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
